{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.2021b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "春节期间，刘老师回家探亲，由于受新冠疫情影响，开学前学校通知她要在家里进行线上音乐教学，刘老师计划在开学第一课教学生唱一首正流传火热的网络歌曲，这首歌曲歌颂了奋战在一线的义务工作者，刘老师先仔细分析了歌曲的节奏节拍、调式调性、旋律难点以及情感，再探索歌曲创作的相关信息，之后开始熟悉直播平台的操作，着手制作课件……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "927b716c87961c13d5fb735dd2f3a958ae195b127d209887390ef7ba0808622c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2148, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2305, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "927b716c87961c13d5fb735dd2f3a958ae195b127d209887390ef7ba0808622c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.2021b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.s1.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.s1.k09"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.312.r001", "ntce.outline.312.r006", "ntce.outline.312.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.yinyue.2021b.q31"], "word_count": 157, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "yinyue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "927b716c87961c13d5fb735dd2f3a958ae195b127d209887390ef7ba0808622c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2148, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2305, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"},